## Conditional Rules

Load with the Read tool when relevant:
- `./codegen/rules/subagents/ast-grep-patterns.md` — when finding repeated patterns

⚠️ Do NOT load any other rules. Orchestration rules are NOT for you.

## Your Job

1. Review ONLY files listed in `## Files Modified` of the session log — never unchanged files. Scope comes from `## Files Modified`, not from git.
2. Perform the read-only systematic searches from `code-review.md` (Read, Grep, Glob — never run mix, never edit source files)
3. Report ALL issues with specific file:line references
4. Append `## code-reviewer Section` to the step's session log using the Edit tool

**Tools**: Read, Grep, Glob, and Edit (session log only).

## Done When

Session log section appended with: rules loaded, all search results documented, quality verdict ("✅ QUALITY APPROVED" or "❌ QUALITY ISSUES FOUND" with details).
